<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scc-page">
{# China Sector Central Intelligence — the Phase-2 consolidation. Renders engine.china_sector_central:
   a regime-gated confluence read per sector/basket with a reasoning trace + the honest forward
   odds + a self-grader. Data is emitted by scripts/build_china_sector_central.py as
   sector_central_china_data.js (window.SECTOR_CENTRAL). Self-contained inline style + render. #}
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<script>try{var t=localStorage.getItem('theme');document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t||'dark');var l=localStorage.getItem('lang')||(function(){try{var L=navigator.languages||[navigator.language||navigator.userLanguage||''],i;for(i=0;i<L.length;i++)if((L[i]||'').toLowerCase().slice(0,2)==='zh')return'zh';if(/Shanghai|Hong_Kong|Macau|Urumqi|Chongqing|Harbin|Kashgar|Chungking/.test(Intl.DateTimeFormat().resolvedOptions().timeZone||''))return'zh';}catch(e){}return'';})();if(l)document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-lang',l);}catch(e){}</script>
<title>China Sector Central Intelligence — Mastermind</title>
<meta name="description" content="One regime-gated confluence read per China sector & theme: where we are (cycle state), what's next (evidence-gated conditional odds), gated by the validated credit/vol/margin regime, confirmed by momentum & flow — with a transparent reasoning trace and a self-grader.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="theme.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="cycle.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="sector_cycles.css">
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font: 14px/1.55 Inter, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; margin: 0; }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .scc-wrap { max-width: 1320px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 16px 22px 60px; }
  .scc-hd { margin: 14px 0 6px; }
  .scc-kick { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  .scc-title { font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 34px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.02em; margin: 4px 0 6px; }
  .scc-sub { color: var(--muted); max-width: 90ch; font-size: 13.5px; }
  .scc-asof { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12.5px; margin-top: 4px; }
  /* regime banner */
  .regime { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; margin: 14px 0; }
  @media (max-width: 880px) { .regime { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  .rg-cell { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 14px; background: var(--panel); }
  .rg-cell.lead { border-width: 1.5px; }
  .rg-k { font-size: 10.5px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .05em; color: var(--muted); }
  .rg-v { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 760; margin-top: 3px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .rg-d { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; }
  .rg-on { color: var(--up); } .rg-off { color: var(--down); } .rg-mix { color: var(--warn); }
  .rg-bar { height: 7px; border-radius: 5px; margin-top: 7px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--line); }
  .rg-bar i { display: block; height: 100%; }
  /* plain "new here?" orientation strip */
  .scc-howto { margin: 12px 0 2px; padding: 11px 14px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--muted);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--link) 6%, var(--panel)); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--link) 22%, var(--line));
    border-left: 3px solid var(--link); border-radius: 11px; max-width: 96ch; }
  .scc-howto b { color: var(--text); }
  /* plain-language headline row spanning the full regime grid */
  .regime .rg-headline-row { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;
    font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 650; line-height: 1.4; padding: 11px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 12px; background: var(--panel); }
  .rg-headline-row .rg-hl-ic { font-size: 16px; flex: none; }
  .rg-headline-row.rg-hl-on { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--up) 42%, var(--line)); }
  .rg-headline-row.rg-hl-on .rg-hl-ic { color: var(--up); }
  .rg-headline-row.rg-hl-off { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--down) 42%, var(--line)); }
  .rg-headline-row.rg-hl-off .rg-hl-ic { color: var(--down); }
  .rg-headline-row.rg-hl-mix .rg-hl-ic { color: var(--warn); }
  /* in zh the up/down colour convention flips (red = up) — match it for banner + badges */
  html[data-lang="zh"] .rg-headline-row.rg-hl-on { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--down) 42%, var(--line)); }
  html[data-lang="zh"] .rg-headline-row.rg-hl-on .rg-hl-ic { color: var(--down); }
  html[data-lang="zh"] .rg-headline-row.rg-hl-off { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--up) 42%, var(--line)); }
  html[data-lang="zh"] .rg-headline-row.rg-hl-off .rg-hl-ic { color: var(--up); }
  html[data-lang="zh"] .rg-v.rg-on { color: var(--down); } html[data-lang="zh"] .rg-v.rg-off { color: var(--up); }
  html[data-lang="zh"] .conv-badge.tier-up { color: var(--down); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--down) 14%, transparent); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--down) 40%, var(--line)); }
  html[data-lang="zh"] .conv-badge.tier-down { color: var(--up); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--up) 14%, transparent); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--up) 40%, var(--line)); }
  /* collapse the redundant inner chart title on the hub */
  .scc-page #sc-hero-title { display: none; }
  /* board universe toggle: redundant with the page-level one on a phone → desktop only.
     (.scc-tabs.scc-tabs-board to outrank the later .scc-tabs{display:flex} base rule.) */
  @media (max-width: 880px) { .scc-tabs.scc-tabs-board { display: none; } }
  /* collapsible reasoning trace on conviction cards */
  .trace-d > summary { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .03em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted);
    cursor: pointer; list-style: none; padding: 4px 0; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .trace-d > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .trace-d > summary::after { content: "▾"; font-size: 10px; transition: transform .2s; }
  .trace-d[open] > summary::after { transform: rotate(180deg); }
  /* the full sector table, relocated BELOW the cycle map + collapsible on mobile */
  .scc-tbl-details { margin: 18px 0 6px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 13px; background: var(--panel); padding: 4px 6px 8px; }
  .scc-tbl-details > summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; padding: 10px 10px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 720;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .scc-tbl-details > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .scc-tbl-details > summary::after { content: "▾"; margin-left: auto; color: var(--muted); transition: transform .2s; }
  .scc-tbl-details[open] > summary::after { transform: rotate(180deg); }
  .scc-tbl-details > summary small { font-weight: 400; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
  /* sub-dashboard rail */
  .scc-rail { display: flex; gap: 9px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 6px 0 16px; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 30;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 92%, transparent); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); padding: 7px 0; }
  .scc-rail a { font-size: 12.5px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 9px; padding: 7px 12px;
    background: var(--panel2, var(--panel)); transition: border-color .15s; }
  .scc-rail a:hover { border-color: var(--muted); }
  /* tabs */
  .scc-tabs { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin: 6px 0 14px; }
  .scc-tab { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 9px; padding: 7px 14px;
    background: transparent; color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer; }
  .scc-tab.on { color: var(--text); background: var(--panel); border-color: var(--muted); }
  /* board */
  .board { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(360px, 1fr)); gap: 13px; }
  .card { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 4px solid var(--c, var(--muted)); border-radius: 13px;
    padding: 13px 15px; background: var(--panel); }
  .card-top { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; }
  .card-nm { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 720; } .card-sub { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 1px; }
  .conv { text-align: right; flex: 0 0 auto; }
  .conv-badge { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .03em; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 7px; }
  .conv-score { font-size: 23px; font-weight: 800; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; line-height: 1.05; margin-top: 3px; }
  .conv-sub { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--muted); }
  .tier-up { color: var(--up); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--up) 14%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--up) 40%, var(--line)); }
  .tier-down { color: var(--down); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--down) 14%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--down) 40%, var(--line)); }
  .tier-flat { color: var(--muted); background: var(--panel2, transparent); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin: 9px 0; }
  .chip2 { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 1px 7px; }
  .chip2 b { color: var(--text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .chip2.early { color: var(--warn); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--warn) 40%, var(--line)); }
  .fwd { font-size: 12px; margin: 8px 0; padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 9px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--link) 6%, var(--panel2, var(--panel))); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--link) 22%, var(--line)); }
  .fwd b { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .trace { margin: 8px 0 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }
  .tr-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: baseline; font-size: 12px; }
  .tr-dot { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; margin-top: 4px; }
  .tr-validated { background: var(--link); } .tr-confirmer { background: var(--warn); } .tr-display { background: var(--muted); }
  .tr-layer { font-weight: 650; flex: 0 0 88px; } .tr-txt { color: var(--muted); }
  .conflu { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 8px; }
  .conflu b.high { color: var(--up); } .conflu b.moderate { color: var(--warn); } .conflu b\.low\/mixed { color: var(--muted); }
  /* grader */
  .grader { margin-top: 26px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 13px; padding: 14px 16px; background: var(--panel); }
  .grader h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 4px; }
  .gr-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .gr-cell { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; background: var(--panel2, transparent); }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); } .sm { font-size: 12px; }
  footer { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11.5px; margin-top: 30px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 12px; max-width: 95ch; }
  /* embedded cycle-map section */
  .scc-cycle { margin: 18px 0 6px; }
  .scc-section-h { margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .scc-section-h h2 { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 760; margin: 0; }
  .scc-section-h .scc-section-sub { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--muted); }
  /* the embedded overlay reuses cycle.css/.sc-* but lives outside a .cyc-wrap — give the stage a panel frame */
  .scc-cycle .cyc-stage { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 13px; padding: 12px 14px; }
  /* embedded live sector desk */
  .scc-desk { margin: 16px 0 6px; }
  .scc-desk-chips { display: flex; gap: 9px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 10px 0; }
  .scc-desk-chips .chipset { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 9px 12px; background: var(--panel); min-width: 200px; flex: 1; }
  .scc-desk-chips .chipset .k { font-size: 10.5px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .scc-desk-chips .ch { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 8px; margin: 0 4px 4px 0; }
  .scc-desk-chips .ch b { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .scc-desk-tblwrap { overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 13px; }
  table.scc-desk-tbl { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; min-width: 920px; font-size: 12.5px; }
  table.scc-desk-tbl th, table.scc-desk-tbl td { padding: 8px 10px; text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  table.scc-desk-tbl th { font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .03em; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; position: sticky; top: 0; background: var(--panel); cursor: pointer; user-select: none; }
  table.scc-desk-tbl th:first-child, table.scc-desk-tbl td:first-child { text-align: left; position: sticky; left: 0; background: var(--panel); }
  table.scc-desk-tbl tbody tr:hover td { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--link) 6%, transparent); }
  .scc-desk-tbl .nm { font-weight: 700; } .scc-desk-tbl .nm small { display: block; font-weight: 400; color: var(--muted); font-size: 10px; }
  .scc-desk-tbl .nm a { color: inherit; border-bottom: 1px dotted color-mix(in srgb, var(--link) 45%, transparent); }
  .scc-desk-tbl .nm a:hover { color: var(--link); border-bottom-color: var(--link); }
  .scc-desk-tbl .up { color: var(--up); } .scc-desk-tbl .dn { color: var(--down); } .scc-desk-tbl .na { color: var(--muted); }
  html[data-lang="zh"] .scc-desk-tbl .up { color: var(--down); } html[data-lang="zh"] .scc-desk-tbl .dn { color: var(--up); }
  .scc-mbar { width: 60px; height: 7px; border-radius: 999px; position: relative; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, color-mix(in srgb,var(--down) 55%,transparent), color-mix(in srgb,var(--muted) 20%,transparent), color-mix(in srgb,var(--up) 55%,transparent)); }
  html[data-lang="zh"] .scc-mbar { background: linear-gradient(90deg, color-mix(in srgb,var(--up) 55%,transparent), color-mix(in srgb,var(--muted) 20%,transparent), color-mix(in srgb,var(--down) 55%,transparent)); }
  .scc-mbar i { position: absolute; top: 50%; width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--panel); border: 2px solid var(--text); transform: translate(-50%,-50%); }
  .scc-cyc { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--panel2, var(--panel)); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .poskey { margin-top: 9px; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .poskey .pk { display: inline-block; width: 18px; height: 8px; border-radius: 999px; }
  .poskey .pk-lo { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--down) 70%, transparent); } .poskey .pk-hi { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--up) 70%, transparent); }
  html[data-lang="zh"] .poskey .pk-lo { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--up) 70%, transparent); } html[data-lang="zh"] .poskey .pk-hi { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--down) 70%, transparent); }
  /* conviction board head + linked toggle (kept prominent so it isn't missed) */
  .scc-boardhead { margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .scc-tabs-board { gap: 10px; margin: 10px 0 14px; }
  .scc-tabs-board .scc-tab { font-size: 13.5px; padding: 9px 16px; border-radius: 10px; border-width: 1.5px; }
  .scc-tabs-board .scc-tab.on { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--link) 12%, var(--panel)); border-color: var(--link); color: var(--text); }
  .scc-tabs-board .scc-tab i { font-style: normal; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--muted); margin-left: 2px; }
  /* conviction card name link */
  .card-nm a { color: inherit; border-bottom: 1px dotted color-mix(in srgb, var(--link) 45%, transparent); transition: color .15s, border-color .15s; }
  .card-nm a:hover { color: var(--link); border-bottom-color: var(--link); }
  /* mobile: pack the live-desk quick-read chips 2-up so they don't push the chart down */
  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .scc-desk-chips { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; }
    .scc-desk-chips .chipset { min-width: 0; }
    .scc-rail { gap: 7px; }
    .scc-rail a { font-size: 12px; padding: 8px 10px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
{% include "_site_nav.html.j2" %}

<div class="scc-wrap">
  <header class="scc-hd">
    <div class="scc-kick"><span class="l-en">China Sector Central Intelligence</span><span class="l-zh">中国行业中枢情报</span> 🇨🇳</div>
    <h1 class="scc-title"><span class="l-en">Every China sector &amp; theme, in one read</span><span class="l-zh">每个中国行业与主题，一个研判</span></h1>
    <p class="scc-sub"><span class="l-en">Every China sector & theme fused into one conviction read: <b>where we are</b> (cycle state) and
      <b>what's next</b> (evidence-gated conditional odds) LEAD; the <b>validated credit/vol/margin regime GATES</b> it; momentum, flow & crowding
      CONFIRM and size — never override. Each card shows its reasoning trace; every dated call is logged and graded.</span><span class="l-zh">将每个中国行业与主题融合为一个信念研判：<b>当前位置</b>（周期状态）与<b>未来倾向</b>（经证据门槛的条件概率）主导；
      经验证的<b>信用/波动率/融资体制进行门控</b>；动量、资金流与拥挤度仅作确认与定仓，绝不反转。每张卡片展示其推理链；每个带日期的判断都会被记录并评分。</span></p>
    <div class="scc-asof"><span class="l-en">As of</span><span class="l-zh">截至</span> <b id="scc-asof">…</b></div>
  </header>

  <p class="scc-howto"><span class="l-en"><b>New here?</b> This page maps where each China sector &amp; theme sits in its cycle on a 0–100 clock. <b>Low</b> = beaten-down / washed-out, <b>high</b> = stretched / late. Tap any line or card to read one sector’s story.</span><span class="l-zh"><b>第一次来？</b>本页用 0–100 时钟展示每个中国行业与主题在其周期中的位置。<b>低</b>=超跌／超卖，<b>高</b>=拉伸／晚期。点按任意曲线或卡片即可查看某行业的走势故事。</span></p>

  <div id="regime" class="regime"></div>
  <div class="scc-rail">
    <a href="#sc-cyclemap">🌀 <span class="l-en">See the cycle map</span><span class="l-zh">查看周期图谱</span></a>
    <a href="#sc-board">🧠 <span class="l-en">Conviction board</span><span class="l-zh">信念研判</span></a>
    <a href="#sc-desk-table" id="sc-rail-table">📊 <span class="l-en">Full sector table</span><span class="l-zh">完整行业表</span></a>
    <a href="baskets_china.html">🧺 <span class="l-en">Thematic Baskets &amp; Rotation</span><span class="l-zh">主题篮子与轮动</span> →</a>
  </div>

  {# ===== LIVE SECTOR DESK — the GS-style live board (engine.china_sector_desk), embedded so the
     hub carries the scoreboard. Rendered client-side from chinasectordata/desk.json; hidden until
     it loads so the page degrades cleanly if the desk build hasn't run. #}
  <section class="scc-desk" id="sc-desk" hidden>
    <div class="scc-section-h">
      <h2><span class="l-en">Live sector desk — quick read</span><span class="l-zh">行业实时看板 — 速览</span></h2>
      <span class="scc-section-sub"><span class="l-en">The strongest, weakest, most beaten-down &amp; most overheated sectors right now. The full table is below the cycle map.</span><span class="l-zh">当前最强、最弱、最超跌与最过热的行业。完整表格在周期图谱下方。</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="scc-desk-chips" id="sc-desk-chips"></div>
  </section>

  {# ===== UNIVERSE TOGGLE — the page-level Shenwan⇄Baskets switch. Drives BOTH the cycle
     map and the conviction board (linkTabs() wires both ways); raised out of the chart
     card to here so it heads the toggled region. The live desk above is sectors-only. #}
  <div class="scc-universe">
    <span class="scc-universe-lab"><span class="l-en">Viewing</span><span class="l-zh">查看</span></span>
    <div class="sc-tabs" id="sc-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Shenwan sectors or thematic baskets">
      <button class="sc-tab on" data-fam="sectors" role="tab">🧭 <span class="l-en">Shenwan Sectors</span><span class="l-zh">申万行业</span> <i id="sc-tab-n-sec"></i></button>
      <button class="sc-tab" data-fam="baskets" role="tab">🧺 <span class="l-en">Thematic Baskets</span><span class="l-zh">主题篮子</span> <i id="sc-tab-n-bsk"></i></button>
    </div>
  </div>

  {# ===== CYCLE MAP — the sector_cycles overlay, embedded so the hub carries the charting =====
     Reuses sector_cycles.js + mm_charts.js over window.SECTOR_CYCLES (the China cycles data). The
     scorecards (sc-cards) are intentionally omitted — the conviction board below replaces them. #}
  <section class="scc-cycle cyc-page sc-page sc-china" id="sc-cyclemap">
    <div class="scc-section-h">
